---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const lastUpdated = 'June 2026';
---

<Layout
  lang="en"
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for Milos.guide — how we handle your data, cookies, and third-party services."
>

<section class="policy-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="page-label">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="page-meta">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec sec-sand policy-sec">
  <div class="container policy-layout">

    <nav class="policy-toc">
      <p class="toc-title">Contents</p>
      <a href="#overview">1. Overview</a>
      <a href="#data">2. Data we collect</a>
      <a href="#cookies">3. Cookies</a>
      <a href="#third-party">4. Third-party services</a>
      <a href="#contact-data">5. Contact form</a>
      <a href="#your-rights">6. Your rights</a>
      <a href="#changes">7. Changes</a>
      <a href="#contact-us">8. Contact</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="policy-body">

      <section id="overview" class="policy-section">
        <h2>1. Overview</h2>
        <p>Milos.guide is an independent, ad-free travel guide. We are committed to protecting your privacy and being transparent about how we handle data. This policy explains what information we collect, why, and how you can control it.</p>
        <p>We do not sell your data. We do not run ads. We collect only the minimum necessary to operate the site.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="data" class="policy-section">
        <h2>2. Data we collect</h2>
        <p>Milos.guide is a static website hosted on GitHub Pages. We do not operate a database or store personal data on our own servers. The only personal data we may receive is what you voluntarily provide via the contact form.</p>
        <p>We do not collect:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Names, emails or any personal information from visitors who browse the site</li>
          <li>Payment information of any kind</li>
          <li>Device fingerprints or cross-site tracking data</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section id="cookies" class="policy-section">
        <h2>3. Cookies</h2>
        <p>Milos.guide does not use first-party cookies or tracking cookies. We do not use Google Analytics, Facebook Pixel, or any other analytics or advertising platform.</p>
        <p>Third-party services embedded in the site (such as Google Maps iframes) may set their own cookies when you interact with them. These are governed by Google's privacy policy.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="third-party" class="policy-section">
        <h2>4. Third-party services</h2>
        <p>We use the following third-party services:</p>
        <div class="tp-table">
          <div class="tp-row tp-header">
            <span>Service</span>
            <span>Purpose</span>
            <span>Privacy policy</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tp-row">
            <span>GitHub Pages</span>
            <span>Website hosting</span>
            <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-privacy-statement" target="_blank" rel="noopener">github.com</a>
          </div>
          <div class="tp-row">
            <span>Google Maps</span>
            <span>Embedded maps</span>
            <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">google.com</a>
          </div>
          <div class="tp-row">
            <span>Google Fonts</span>
            <span>Typography</span>
            <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">google.com</a>
          </div>
          <div class="tp-row">
            <span>Google Apps Script</span>
            <span>Contact form</span>
            <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">google.com</a>
          </div>
          <div class="tp-row">
            <span>OpenStreetMap</span>
            <span>Interactive map</span>
            <a href="https://osmfoundation.org/wiki/Privacy_Policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">osmfoundation.org</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p>We have no control over the data practices of these third parties. We recommend reviewing their respective privacy policies.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="contact-data" class="policy-section">
        <h2>5. Contact form</h2>
        <p>When you submit the contact form, your name, email address and message are sent to us via Google Apps Script and stored in a Google Sheets spreadsheet accessible only to the site owner. We use this information solely to respond to your enquiry.</p>
        <p>We do not share this data with third parties, use it for marketing, or retain it longer than necessary.</p>
        <p>You may request deletion of your contact data at any time by emailing us (see Section 8).</p>
      </section>

      <section id="your-rights" class="policy-section">
        <h2>6. Your rights</h2>
        <p>Depending on your location, you may have the following rights under applicable privacy law (including the EU General Data Protection Regulation — GDPR):</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Access</strong> — request a copy of any personal data we hold about you</li>
          <li><strong>Rectification</strong> — request correction of inaccurate data</li>
          <li><strong>Erasure</strong> — request deletion of your data</li>
          <li><strong>Objection</strong> — object to processing of your data</li>
          <li><strong>Portability</strong> — receive your data in a portable format</li>
        </ul>
        <p>To exercise any of these rights, please contact us using the details in Section 8.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="changes" class="policy-section">
        <h2>7. Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this policy from time to time. When we do, we will update the "Last updated" date at the top of this page. We encourage you to review this page periodically.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="contact-us" class="policy-section">
        <h2>8. Contact</h2>
        <p>If you have any questions about this privacy policy or wish to exercise your rights, please get in touch via the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>
      </section>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

</Layout>

<style>
.policy-hero {
  background: var(--white);
  padding: 3rem 0 2rem;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
}
.page-label {
  display: block;
  font-size: 0.68rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--sea);
  margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
}
.page-title {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
  color: var(--deep-blue);
  line-height: 1.1;
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}
.page-meta {
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  color: var(--muted);
}

.policy-sec { min-height: 60vh; }

.policy-layout {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 220px 1fr;
  gap: 4rem;
  align-items: start;
  padding-top: 3rem;
  padding-bottom: 5rem;
}

/* TOC */
.policy-toc {
  position: sticky;
  top: calc(var(--header-h) + 1.5rem);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.15rem;
}
.toc-title {
  font-size: 0.62rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--muted);
  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
}
.policy-toc a {
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  color: var(--muted);
  padding: 0.3rem 0;
  border-left: 2px solid transparent;
  padding-left: 0.75rem;
  transition: color 0.15s, border-color 0.15s, padding-left 0.15s;
}
.policy-toc a:hover {
  color: var(--aegean);
  border-color: var(--aegean);
}

/* Body */
.policy-body {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0;
}

.policy-section {
  padding: 2rem 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  scroll-margin-top: calc(var(--header-h) + 1.5rem);
}
.policy-section:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

.policy-section h2 {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 1.35rem;
  color: var(--deep-blue);
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

.policy-section p {
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  color: var(--ink);
  line-height: 1.8;
  margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
}
.policy-section p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

.policy-section ul {
  margin: 0.5rem 0 0.85rem 1.25rem;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.4rem;
}
.policy-section ul li {
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  color: var(--ink);
  line-height: 1.7;
}
.policy-section a {
  color: var(--aegean);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--sea);
  padding-bottom: 1px;
}
.policy-section a:hover { color: var(--sea); }
.policy-section strong { font-weight: 600; }

/* Third party table */
.tp-table {
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  overflow: hidden;
  margin: 1rem 0;
}
.tp-row {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 1rem;
  padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  background: var(--white);
  align-items: center;
}
.tp-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.tp-row:nth-child(even) { background: var(--sand); }
.tp-header {
  background: var(--deep-blue) !important;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
  font-size: 0.65rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}
.tp-row a { color: var(--aegean); font-size: 0.8rem; }

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .policy-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; }
  .policy-toc { position: static; flex-direction: row; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; }
  .toc-title { display: none; }
  .policy-toc a { border-left: none; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem; font-size: 0.75rem; }
  .tp-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  .tp-row span:nth-child(3), .tp-row a { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  .tp-header span:nth-child(3) { display: none; }
}
</style>